"But if you are one of those who are incapable of impersonal interests, you may find that your life will be empty unless you care about your children and grandchildren. In that case, you need to realize that while you can still provide them with material services, like making them an allowance or knitting sweaters for them, you shouldn't expect them to enjoy your company."
