Limit TV/radio news: It's important to be informed, but you don't need to be informed all day. Centuries ago, news reached a small town only when travelers arrived, perhaps only once or twice a month.
Better listen to music: Music fills the air around you with beauty instead of grim tragedies. Listening to the songs you love will lift your spirits.
